omxplorer on an iPhone (390x844): the same spreadsheet app, sheet of a 1,000,000-row orders CSV. Top: document name "orders.csv" with a back chevron and a "…" menu. A horizontal strip of tools: Chart, Pivot, Formula, Sort, Filter, Format. The grid fills the screen: a narrow row-number gutter, frozen first column order_id, columns date, region, revenue visible, revenue selected (header tinted) with type badges and tiny histograms in the headers. A bottom sheet at half height shows the selected column: "revenue" with Sum $72,061,236.00, Average $72.06, Count 1,000,000, a histogram, and a Format row (Currency, 2 decimals). Floating tab bar at the bottom: Sheet, Report, + . Thumb-friendly 48px targets.
